<details><summary>Methodology</summary>

**Goal totals** follow the [IFFHS](https://iffhs.com) criteria used in the [List of footballers with 500 or more goals](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_footballers_with_500_or_more_goals):

- ✅ **Top-level club goals** — league, national cup, and continental competition goals for first-team squads
- ✅ **Senior national team goals** — all competitive and friendly internationals for the senior squad
- ❌ Reserve / B-team / youth team goals excluded (e.g. Haaland's Bryne 2 & Molde 2, Mbappe's Monaco II, Yamal's Barça B)

**Season totals** (per row in the chart) combine club goals from that football season with international goals from the corresponding calendar year. **World Cup goals** (🌐) are attributed to the season in which the tournament was played and are included in the season total.

**Markers:** 🌐 World Cup goals subset · 🥾 World Cup Golden Boot · 🏆 World Cup winner · 👟 European Golden Shoe · ⚽️ Ballon d'Or

</details>

